**1. Update `src/components/settings/types.ts`**:

```typescript
export type SectionKey = 'general' | 'notification-preferences' | 'labels' | 'ai-key';
export type ToastType = 'success' | 'fail' | 'info';

export interface ToastAction {
  label: string;
  onClick: () => void;
}

export interface SectionProps {
  showToast: (message: string, type?: ToastType, action?: ToastAction, duration?: number) => void;
  workspaceId: number;
}
```

Add `'ai-key'` to `SectionKey` union. Add `ToastAction` interface. Extend `showToast` signature with optional `action` and `duration` parameters.

**2. Update `src/components/settings/SettingsShell.tsx`** — Multiple changes:

**2a. Import GeminiKeySection** (lazy-loaded to avoid loading encryption on non-OWNER pages):
```typescript
import { GeminiKeySection } from './GeminiKeySection';
import type { ToastAction } from './types';
```

**2b. Add AI 설정 nav item** to `NAV_ITEMS` array (append as last item):
```typescript
{
  key: 'ai-key' as SectionKey,
  label: 'AI 설정',
  icon: (
    <svg width={16} height={16} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth={2} strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round">
      <path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.61 7.61a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-7.778 7.778 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.777-7.777zm0 0L15.5 7.5m0 0l3 3L22 7l-3-3m-3.5 3.5L19 4"/>
    </svg>
  ),
},
```

**2c. Extend `ToastState` interface** (inside SettingsShell.tsx):
```typescript
interface ToastState {
  message: string;
  type: ToastType;
  action?: ToastAction;
}
```

**2d. Replace `showToast` function** with version supporting actions:
```typescript
function showToast(message: string, type: ToastType = 'success', action?: ToastAction, duration?: number) {
  setToast({ message, type, action });
  setTimeout(() => setToast(null), duration ?? (action ? 8000 : 3000));
}
```

When `action` is provided and no explicit duration: use 8000ms (D-07). Default without action: 3000ms.

**2e. Update `visibleNavItems` filtering** — OWNER-only for `ai-key`:

Replace current filtering logic:
```typescript
const isOwner = role === 'OWNER';
const visibleNavItems = NAV_ITEMS.filter((item) => {
  if (item.key === 'ai-key') return isOwner;
  if (isViewer) return VIEWER_ALLOWED_SECTIONS.includes(item.key);
  return true;
});
```

**2f. Update `initialSection` guard** — non-OWNER ai-key URL redirect:
```typescript
const initialSection =
  (!isOwner && rawSection === 'ai-key') ? 'general' :
  (isViewer && !VIEWER_ALLOWED_SECTIONS.includes(rawSection)) ? 'general' :
  rawSection;
```

Note: the `isOwner` check MUST come before the `isViewer` check to handle MEMBER correctly (MEMBER is not viewer but also not owner).

**2g. Update `sectionRenderers`** — add ai-key with OWNER guard:
```typescript
const sectionRenderers: Record<SectionKey, ReactNode> = {
  general: <GeneralSection showToast={showToast} workspaceId={workspaceId} />,
  'notification-preferences': <NotificationPreferencesSection showToast={showToast} workspaceId={workspaceId} />,
  labels: <LabelSection showToast={showToast} workspaceId={workspaceId} />,
  'ai-key': isOwner ? <GeminiKeySection showToast={showToast} workspaceId={workspaceId} /> : null,
};
```

**2h. Extend toast rendering** — add action button:

In the `toastEl` block, add an action button next to the message icon+text:
```typescript
const toastEl = toast ? (
  <div
    role="status"
    aria-live="polite"
    style={{
      position: 'fixed', top: 80, right: 20, padding: '10px 16px', borderRadius: 6,
      fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 500, boxShadow: '0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12)', zIndex: 500,
      display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, animation: 'toastIn 0.2s ease',
      ...(toast.type === 'success'
        ? { background: '#ECFDF5', color: '#059669', border: '1px solid #A7F3D0' }
        : toast.type === 'fail'
          ? { background: '#FEF2F2', color: '#DC2626', border: '1px solid #FECACA' }
          : { background: '#EFF6FF', color: '#2563EB', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE' }),
    }}
  >
    {toast.type === 'success' ? '✓' : toast.type === 'fail' ? '✕' : 'ℹ'} {toast.message}
    {toast.action && (
      <button
        onClick={() => { toast.action!.onClick(); setToast(null); }}
        style={{
          marginLeft: 8,
          padding: '4px 10px',
          borderRadius: 4,
          border: '1px solid currentColor',
          background: 'transparent',
          color: 'inherit',
          cursor: 'pointer',
          fontSize: 12,
          fontWeight: 600,
        }}
      >
        {toast.action.label}
      </button>
    )}
  </div>
) : null;
```

The action button inherits toast color, has a 1px border, and clears the toast after click.
