  <action>
Create `src/components/settings/GeminiKeySection.tsx` — client component with full state machine per UI-SPEC.

**CRITICAL: Read `01-UI-SPEC.md` before implementing.** All colors, typography, spacing, and copywriting come from that contract.

```typescript
'use client';

import { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from 'react';
import { ConfirmDialog } from '@/components/ui/ConfirmDialog';
import type { SectionProps } from './types';
```

**State machine type and state:**
```typescript
type UIState =
  | 'IDLE_NO_KEY'
  | 'IDLE_HAS_KEY'
  | 'REPLACE_MODE'
  | 'SAVING'
  | 'DELETING'
  | 'DELETE_CONFIRM_OPEN';

interface KeyMeta {
  maskedKey: string;
  updatedAt: string;
}
```

**Component props:** Receive `SectionProps` (`showToast` + `workspaceId`).

**State variables:**
- `uiState: UIState` — initialized to `'IDLE_NO_KEY'`
- `keyMeta: KeyMeta | null` — fetched masked key data
- `inputValue: string` — controlled input for API key
- `showPassword: boolean` — toggle for password visibility
- `error: string | null` — inline error message below input
- `isLoading: boolean` — initial fetch loading

**useEffect on mount:** Fetch GET `/api/settings/gemini-key`:
- On success with data: set `keyMeta`, set `uiState = 'IDLE_HAS_KEY'`
- On success with null data: keep `uiState = 'IDLE_NO_KEY'`
- On error: show toast with fail message

**handleSave function:**
1. Set `uiState = 'SAVING'`, clear `error`
2. POST `/api/settings/gemini-key` with body `{ apiKey: inputValue }`
3. On success (`data.saved === true`):
   - Set `keyMeta = { maskedKey: data.maskedKey, updatedAt: new Date().toISOString() }`
   - Set `uiState = 'IDLE_HAS_KEY'`
   - Capture `inputValue` before clearing: `const savedKey = inputValue`
   - Clear `inputValue = ''`
   - Call `showToast` with action: `showToast('API 키가 저장되었습니다. 지금 복사하세요 \u2014 창을 닫으면 전체 키를 다시 볼 수 없습니다.', 'success', { label: '복사', onClick: () => navigator.clipboard.writeText(savedKey) }, 8000)`
4. On error with code `PROBE_FAILED`: set `error = '유효하지 않은 API 키입니다. Gemini API에 접근할 수 없었습니다.'`, set `uiState` back to previous (IDLE_NO_KEY or REPLACE_MODE)
5. On error with code `PROBE_NETWORK_ERROR`: set `error = '키 유효성 확인에 실패했습니다. 네트워크 연결을 확인해주세요.'`, set `uiState` back
6. On other error: set generic error message, set `uiState` back

**handleDelete function:**
1. Set `uiState = 'DELETING'`
2. DELETE `/api/settings/gemini-key`
3. On success: set `keyMeta = null`, `uiState = 'IDLE_NO_KEY'`, `inputValue = ''`
4. Call `showToast('API 키가 삭제되었습니다.', 'success')`
5. On error: `showToast('삭제에 실패했습니다.', 'fail')`, set `uiState = 'IDLE_HAS_KEY'`

**Render structure** (follow UI-SPEC exactly):

**Section Header** (always shown):
- Title: "AI 설정" — `fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 700, color: '#2C3E50', fontFamily: "'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif"`
- Description: "Gemini API 키를 등록하면 마크다운을 티켓으로 자동 변환할 수 있습니다." — `fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 400, color: '#5A6B7F', marginTop: 4`

**Key Status Card** (shown when `uiState === 'IDLE_HAS_KEY' || uiState === 'DELETE_CONFIRM_OPEN' || uiState === 'DELETING'`):
```
border: 1px solid #DFE1E6, borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, background: #fff
```
- Row 1: Label "등록된 API 키" `(12px, 700, #5A6B7F)` + masked value `(12px, 400, #2C3E50, fontFamily: monospace)`
- Row 2: "마지막 수정" + formatted date `(11px, 400, #8993A4)`
- Actions row (gap: 8px):
  - "키 교체" button — secondary style: `background: transparent, border: 1px solid #DFE1E6, color: #5A6B7F, borderRadius: 6, padding: '6px 14px', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 500`
  - "API 키 삭제" button — ghost danger: `background: transparent, border: none, color: #DC2626, fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 500, cursor: pointer`

**Key Input Form** (shown when `uiState === 'IDLE_NO_KEY' || uiState === 'REPLACE_MODE' || uiState === 'SAVING'`):

When `uiState === 'IDLE_NO_KEY'` and `keyMeta === null`, show empty state heading:
- "API 키가 등록되지 않았습니다" `(12px, 700, #5A6B7F)`
- "Gemini API 키를 등록하면 마크다운 파일을 티켓으로 자동 변환할 수 있습니다." `(12px, 400, #5A6B7F)`

Input field:
- `<label htmlFor="gemini-api-key" style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 700, color: '#2C3E50' }}>Gemini API 키</label>`
- Container div with position: relative for the toggle button:
  - `<input id="gemini-api-key" type={showPassword ? 'text' : 'password'} value={inputValue} onChange={...} placeholder="AIza로 시작하는 API 키를 입력하세요" disabled={uiState === 'SAVING'} />`
  - Input styles: `width: '100%', height: 36, padding: '8px 40px 8px 12px', border: error ? '1px solid #DC2626' : '1px solid #DFE1E6', borderRadius: 6, fontSize: 12, outline: 'none', background: uiState === 'SAVING' ? '#F8F9FB' : '#fff', cursor: uiState === 'SAVING' ? 'not-allowed' : 'text', opacity: uiState === 'SAVING' ? 0.7 : 1`
  - Focus styles (apply via onFocus/onBlur state): `border: '1px solid #629584', boxShadow: '0 0 0 3px #E8F5F0'`
  - Error styles: `border: '1px solid #DC2626', boxShadow: '0 0 0 3px #FEF2F2'`
  - Eye toggle button (position: absolute, right: 8, top: 50%, transform translateY(-50%)):
    - `aria-label={showPassword ? 'API 키 숨기기' : 'API 키 표시'}`
    - Min touch area 32x32px
    - Toggle `showPassword` on click
    - Eye open/closed SVG icons (16x16, stroke-based, strokeWidth=2)
  - **CRITICAL:** `onKeyDown` handler: prevent Enter from submitting (`e.key === 'Enter' && e.preventDefault()`) — per UI-SPEC accessibility contract

- Helper text (below input): "키는 즉시 암호화되어 저장됩니다. 저장 후에는 전체 키를 다시 볼 수 없습니다." — `fontSize: 11, color: '#8993A4', marginTop: 4`

- Inline error zone (below helper, shown when `error !== null`):
  - `<div role="alert" style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#DC2626', marginTop: 4 }}>{error}</div>`

- Actions row (marginTop: 16, gap: 8):
  - "API 키 저장" button — primary CTA:
    - `background: '#629584', color: '#fff', borderRadius: 6, padding: '8px 20px', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 600, border: 'none', cursor: 'pointer'`
    - Hover: `background: '#527D6F'`
    - Disabled when `inputValue.trim() === ''` or `uiState === 'SAVING'`: `opacity: 0.45, cursor: 'not-allowed'`
    - Loading state (`uiState === 'SAVING'`): show spinner + "확인 중..." text, `aria-busy="true"`
  - "취소" button (shown ONLY in REPLACE_MODE): secondary style, calls `setUiState('IDLE_HAS_KEY')` and clears input/error

**Delete Confirm Dialog** (shown when `uiState === 'DELETE_CONFIRM_OPEN'`):
```typescript
<ConfirmDialog
  isOpen={uiState === 'DELETE_CONFIRM_OPEN'}
  onClose={() => setUiState('IDLE_HAS_KEY')}
  onConfirm={handleDelete}
  title="API 키를 삭제하시겠습니까?"
  description="삭제 후 AI 기능을 사용하려면 새 키를 다시 등록해야 합니다."
  confirmText="API 키 삭제"
  cancelText="취소"
  variant="danger"
/>
```

**Date formatting:** For "마지막 수정" display, format `updatedAt` using `new Date(updatedAt).toLocaleDateString('ko-KR', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })` — yields "2026년 4월 11일" format.

**Spinner for SAVING state:** Small inline CSS spinner or a simple "..." animation. Use existing codebase pattern if available, otherwise:
```typescript
<span style={{ display: 'inline-block', width: 14, height: 14, border: '2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3)', borderTopColor: '#fff', borderRadius: '50%', animation: 'spin 0.6s linear infinite', marginRight: 6 }} />
```
Add `@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg) } }` via inline style or check if global CSS has it.

**Style approach:** Use inline style objects matching the existing SettingsShell pattern. Follow `fieldInputStyle` pattern from `GeneralSection.tsx` for input field dimensions. No new CSS files.
  </action>
