- Input has `id="gemini-api-key"` with matching `<label htmlFor="gemini-api-key">`
- Eye toggle button has `aria-label` that toggles between "API 키 표시" and "API 키 숨기기"
- Save button shows `aria-busy="true"` during SAVING state
- Error div has `role="alert"`
- Input `onKeyDown` prevents Enter (`e.key === 'Enter' && e.preventDefault()`)
- Section title is "AI 설정" (14px, 700)
- Colors match UI-SPEC: accent `#629584`, danger `#DC2626`, text `#2C3E50`, secondary text `#5A6B7F`
- Save button loading text is "확인 중..."
- "취소" button shown only in REPLACE_MODE
